  "description": "Driving at night can be pretty tricky, especially if your headlights no longer light up the road. When you drive with dim headlights, you not only put yourself at risk but everyone else on the road as well. Stay safe and replace your headlights as soon as they begin to lose their shine. Put yourself and other drivers at ease, upgrade with a new high-performance set of YITAMOTOR headlights and feel more confident when driving at night.\nFitment\nFor 2004-2008 Ford F150 Pickup\nFor 2006-2008 Lincoln Mark LT\nNOT Compatible with 2004 F150 Heritage\nNOT Compatible with Flareside Beds Models\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nCompatibility: Headlights assembly compatible with 2004-2008 Ford F150/2006-2008 Lincoln Mark LT; NOT Compatible with 2004 F150 Heritage; NOT Compatible with Flareside Beds Models; High beam bulb type: H13; Low beam bulb type: H13; Turn signal bulb type: 3157A/4157A; Bulbs are not included; Professional installation would be highly recommended\nBrighter illumination: The metallic parabolic reflectors generate increased light output, producing a broader and more uniform beam distribution\nWaterproof: It is fully sealed with solid silicone and features one-way vent to prevent moisture trapping inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries, the headlights assembly maintains operational integrity in sorts of weather conditions\nImprove Safety: The sided micro-prism reflectors enhance nighttime visibility by reflecting headlights beams back toward their source, enabling rapid detection by oncoming vehicles or pedestrians and improving safety for both the driver and surrounding road users\nImpact Resistance: The polycarbonate lens and rugged housing exhibit impact and vibration resistance, enabling reliable performance under extreme road conditions",
